<item>
            <title>[ZEPPELIN-1] Update Zeppelin to Spark 1.3 APIs</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/ZEPPELIN-1</link>
                <project id="12316221" key="ZEPPELIN">Zeppelin</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Zeppelin currently breaks under Spark 1.3.  The issues are twofold:&lt;br/&gt;
First, SchemaRDD has been deprecated and replaced by DataFrame.  Second, some of the calls made against SparkILoop and SparkIMain have been privatized and are no longer available.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
